From: Vincent Hao <49104178+VinceHow@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:10:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Painted look: her name tag as the first-open paper step
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The character card on ?look=painted is styled through hooks only (data-component, data-slot, data-state,
aria-pressed, voice.js's data-field): an inked underline for her name, the two seats as ink pills (hers in her pink
crayon), her words on her paper, the voice pill, a plain status line, the make button (make · busy · retry · meet),
and the team's read of her below, with "Meet your team" last. Behind it, the studio door, blurred and warm
(cast/intro/door.jpg, added).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013ka3w4mYCjZQ4UZXpyjYjQ
